{"body":{"kept":"In brief, at the author's word: 11 of the 20 utterances, each in the author's own words and at its place in the order, the last without the direction it pasted from another project. Whether each came spoken or typed is the session's own reading. The session's answers were not kept. What it decided stands in the format, src/tools/vectors/README.md, with what is left open at its end. Six agents reasoned about the format and attacked it, at about 684,000 tokens against an estimate of 300,000. Counted names were chosen first and let go when a store could not be taken away, changed and brought back; short unique names cost about 10% more in the whole field, gzipped. GitHub Pages was measured gzipping these files from a throwaway repository, steward-of-cwejman/static-host-test.","on":"2026-11-08","paths":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0PW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0PY"}],"said":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB04C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB088"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB098"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0BW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0DP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0F2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0GE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0HX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0JE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0PV"}],"voice":{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0Q0"}},"id":"1M6Y8YRYWTTB0PZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000000"],"name":"A fifth session, kept in brief: the store's format settled by attack, the store made blocks, and the code asked for"}
